    <briefdescription>
<para>SAGA <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_logger" kindref="compound">Logger</ref> with PKI-signed batch encryption for tamper-proof audit trail. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Workflow:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Collect SAGA steps in memory buffer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>When batch_size or batch_interval reached: a. Serialize batch to canonical JSON b. Encrypt with current LEK (AES-256-GCM) c. Compute SHA-256 hash over ciphertext d. Sign hash with PKI e. Persist ciphertext + signature metadata</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Verification: Load ciphertext → verify signature → decrypt → validate </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
